        x86_64     1:1.21.0-1.fc42                         updates              24.2 MiB\n\nTransaction Summary:\n Removing:          41 packages\n\nAfter this operation, 288 MiB will be freed (install 0 B, remove 288 MiB).\nIs this ok [y/N]: y\nRunning transaction\nPackage was not found in rpm database\n</code></pre>\n<p>Any ideas?</p>", "post_number": 1, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 5, "updated_at": "2025-12-28T06:19:28.646Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 52, "reads": 19, "readers_count": 18, "score": 263.8, "yours": false, "topic_id": 178597, "topic_slug": "trouble-upgrading-from-f42-to-f43-aardvark-dns-package-conflict", "display_username": "Jarrett Coker", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": null, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 31340, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 1, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/trouble-upgrading-from-f42-to-f43-aardvark-dns-package-conflict/178597/1", "event": null, "calendar_details": [], "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 468667, "name": "Vladislav Grigoryev", "username": "vgaetera", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/vgaetera/{size}/2552_2.png", "created_at": "2025-12-28T11:56:56.052Z", "cooked": "<p>None of the packages listed above are critical.<br>\nYou can proceed with removal and reinstall it after upgrading.</p>\n<p>See also: <a href=\"https://discussion.fedoraproject.org/t/systems-with-wine-installed-cannot-be-upgraded-to-fedora-43/170296\" class=\"inline-onebox\">Systems with wine installed cannot be upgraded to Fedora 43</a></p>", "post_number": 2, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 5, "updated_at": "2025-12-28T11:59:23.059Z", "reply_count": 1, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 6, "reads": 19, "readers_count": 18, "score": 53.8, "yours": false, "topic_id": 178597, "topic_slug": "trouble-upgrading-from-f42-to-f43-aardvark-dns-package-conflict", "display_username": "Vladislav Grigoryev", "primary_group_name": "ask-fedora", "flair_name": "ask-fedora", "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": "", "flair_color": "", "flair_group_id": 53, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "link_counts": [{"url": "https://discussion.fedoraproject.org/t/systems-with-wine-installed-cannot-be-upgraded-to-fedora-43/170296", "internal": true, "reflection": false, "title": "Systems with wine installed cannot be upgraded to Fedora 43", "clicks": 10}], "read": true, "user_title": "", "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [{"id": 2, "count": 1}], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 549, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 3, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/trouble-upgrading-from-f42-to-f43-aardvark-dns-package-conflict/178597/2", "event": null, "reactions": [{"id": "heart", "type": "emoji", "count": 1}], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 1, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 468702, "name": "Jarrett Coker", "username": "elite-moose-task-force", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/e/603e79/{size}.png", "created_at": "2025-12-28T15:48:42.890Z", "cooked": "<p>Thank you for the assistance. Wine was removed successfully but I am still having issue with aardvark-dns where <code>Package was not found in rpm database</code></p>", "post_number": 3, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 5, "updated_at": "2025-12-28T15:48:42.890Z", "reply_count": 1, "reply_to_post_number": 2, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 4, "reads": 15, "readers_count": 14, "score": 28.0, "yours": false, "topic_id": 178597, "topic_slug": "trouble-upgrading-from-f42-to-f43-aardvark-dns-package-conflict", "display_username": "Jarrett Coker", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": null, "reply_to_user": {"id": 549, "username": "vgaetera", "name": "Vladislav Grigoryev", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/vgaetera/{size}/2552_2.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 31340, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 1, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/trouble-upgrading-from-f42-to-f43-aardvark-dns-package-conflict/178597/3", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 468703, "name": "Vladislav Grigoryev", "username": "vgaetera", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/vgaetera/{size}/2552_2.png", "created_at": "2025-12-28T15:51:36.230Z", "cooked": "<p>Switch to permissive SELinux mode and rebuild the database:</p>\n<pre data-code-wrap=\"bash\"><code class=\"lang-bash\">sudo setenforce 0\nsudo rpm --rebuilddb\n</code></pre>\n<p>If the issue persists, try this way:</p>\n<pre data-code-wrap=\"bash\"><code class=\"lang-bash\">sudo rpm -e --nodeps aardvark-dns-2:1.17.0-1.fc42.x86_64\n</code></pre>", "post_number": 4, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 5, "updated_at": "2025-12-30T17:38:52.743Z", "reply_count": 1, "reply_to_post_number": 3, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 0, "reads": 14, "readers_count": 13, "score": 22.8, "yours": false, "topic_id": 178597, "topic_slug": "trouble-upgrading-from-f42-to-f43-aardvark-dns-package-conflict", "display_username": "Vladislav Grigoryev", "primary_group_name": "ask-fedora", "flair_name": "ask-fedora", "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": "", "flair_color": "", "flair_group_id": 53, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": "", "reply_to_user": {"id": 31340, "username": "elite-moose-task-force", "name": "Jarrett Coker", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/e/603e79/{size}.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [{"id": 2, "count": 1}], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 549, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 3, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/trouble-upgrading-from-f42-to-f43-aardvark-dns-package-conflict/178597/4", "event": null, "reactions": [{"id": "heart", "type": "emoji", "count": 1}], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 1, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": true, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 468707, "name": "Jarrett Coker", "username": "elite-moose-task-force", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/e/603e79/{size}.png", "created_at": "2025-12-28T16:31:30.182Z", "cooked": "<p>Ok cool, I am on f43 now! But.. should I be concerned about this?</p>\n<p>I ran the <code>sudo rpm --rebuilddb</code> command and it had some output along the lines of:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-plaintext\">\nsomething about aardvark-dns\n[HASH] != [HASH]\n[HASH] != [HASH]\n</code></pre>\n<p>I am sorry I did not copy the output from the terminal at the time. I closed the terminal by habit and was unable to retrieve it again when I ran that command a 2nd time. [HASH] is just a placeholder for the actual hash key I saw but I don’t remember what it was. Is there a way I can see the output of previous bash commands? I will try and find the actual output it gave to me. Also do I need to reinstall aardvark-dns now that I am on f43?</p>\n<p>Thank you so much for the assistance by the way Vladislav Grigoryev, I really appreciate all your help!</p>", "post_number": 5, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 5, "updated_at": "2025-12-28T18:22:08.985Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": 4, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 0, "reads": 13, "readers_count": 12, "score": 17.6, "yours": false, "topic_id": 178597, "topic_slug": "trouble-upgrading-from-f42-to-f43-aardvark-dns-package-conflict", "display_username": "Jarrett Coker", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 3, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": null, "reply_to_user": {"id": 549, "username": "vgaetera", "name": "Vladislav Grigoryev", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/vgaetera/{size}/2552_2.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [{"id": 2, "count": 1}], "moderator": false, "